 almost guilt or stress they're  like oh my god the goals that i thought  i was going to be able to do are not  realistic anymore and what we're telling  our team members and what we tell  everyone is no one is judging anyone  right now anyone i only judge the people  who are judging others  we keep telling folks you take  bite-sized chunks and then you do it in  this as high quality as you can but  don't think about quantity or the same  productivity right now no one's capable  of it  right and no one is judging it and and  you just have to release yourself i  think for example a lot of schools even  my own children's schools they've given  a very robust list of things for the  students to do but i i i think i can  speak on their behalf they completely  get that if uh kids or their parents are  not in a position to keep the kids to do  everything on that checklist it's  completely okay we're all trying to cope  with this situation in whatever way we  can  so uh dave thanks so much for joining  we're at time every day this you know  this half an hour goes by fast and today  was even faster than normal a sign of  how much fun we're having uh i think  you're gonna be able to join us uh  hopefully in  future live streams and i just want to  tell everyone as what dave and i just  said uh you know you you might feel  physically separated from others and  dave gave some good ideas for how you  might become feel a little bit mentally  closer uh or emotionally closer to  others in this type of crisis and the  whole point of this live stream is for  all of us to realize that we're in this  together the whole world is going  through this  so as best as you can uh you know keep  safe and stay healthy and don't beat up  yourself too much and and take some time  to breathe relax meditate whatever it  takes to kind of give yourself that that  mental reset  we'll see you tomorrow  any brilliant advice  you
 

